OL,3,AWebsites taken down worldwide as
OL,4,Acritical cyber-security update issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternational governments and agencies
OL,7,Fhave urged websites to address two
OL,8,Fcritical cyber-security flaws in a
OL,9,Fprogramming language which powers much
OL,10,Fof the internet.
OL,12,FThe vulnerabilities were found within
OL,13,Fthe PHP programming language, with a
OL,14,Ffix issued on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,16,FMultiple cyber-security agencies have
OL,17,Furged organisations unable to apply
OL,18,Ffixes in time to consider taking their
OL,19,Fsites down, leading bodies such as the
OL,20,FFinnish government, Edinburgh council
OL,21,Fand the BBC to take pages offline.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,114,105,200,160,0,100
